Z||000000||Coconut||05-29-2000||02:24 PM||||I figured I'd start a new thread so Doughboy could get some serious answers.  Ya know, GTGirl and me have been friends for a very long time(even before we got serious)so I guess that I'm pretty used to her always getting attention. Doesn't bother me, I guess just as long as there is a certain amount of trust and respect in a relationship and being secure in yourself,there's no room for anything negative like jealousy or any of that B.S.<P>I just thought it was pretty funny when I came home from work one day, she had introduced herself on the forum & BOOM!! all those replies. My first reaction was - what the heck were you saying to these guys to get such a reaction!?! Did you post nude pics or something!?!. We both laughed and she started showing me all the different threads and topics and archives,etc. But what I thought was cool,were the different personalities. She was right, Good bunch of people here. Anyhow, regarding the way she was welcomed.....Think about it, Batboy wrote a thread about seeing a cute fiero girl and granted,every guy on this planet has always had a thing about seeing that Beautiful girl in the Hot car waving at him. It's the "Classic" fantasy!! Even George Lucas had to capture that vision on screen(American Graffiti). I'm sure most of the dudes had the hormones going at the time of her posting . She just happened to be there when all these imaginations were running wild. Nothing more. I will admit that it is a BIG plus when your spouse shares alot of the same interests as you. Helps to develop the Friendship aspect of the relationship. She truly is My Friend, Lover, and Wife and would not give her up for anything in this world.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Ozzy||05-29-2000||04:46 PM||||Hey Coconut...Don't know if I'm outta line expressing an opinion here or not...<P>I too was a little surprised at the response received by FieroGTGirl...I think I responded too but preceding my welcome statement with "My <B>wife</B> and I"...relevance; we also live in Washington and she also likes our little mid engine friends.<P>My point would be this...Go into a bar or public place of some sort based on a social type gathering with your fairer half...this happens for women too...there is always some guy/girl makin' flirty gestures and eyes at your missus/Mr! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Add to that the veil of the internet...Ah yes, the anonymous concept! Most have participated in some form of chat/flirting type of scenario ranging from the light to the explicit.<P>I don't know what the circumstances were that created this exactly. Perhaps as you say; (<I>"An Affair To Remember" music playing in the background!</I>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> The perfect fairy tale Fiero romance story had just hit the press so to speak. (Batboy's mystery Fiero Girl)<P>We have several other Female members...I don't recall them inspiring the same response. I don't really know why to be honest...<P>If you were offended in anyway, I'm sure that was not the intention. The anonimity of the internet sets the tone for these situations.<P><I>Disclaimer: The attitudes and/or opinions expressed specifically in this post are not those of the Forum, or it's other members, owners, owners friend's, cousins, sisters, yada, yada, yada! Judges decision is final and no correspondence shall be entered into; I have no recollection o' that...Monica Who??<BR>General A$$ covering statements designed to cover ones butt and not pi$$ people off.</I>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ozzy||||reg||1
