Z||000003||FieroGTGirl||05-29-2000||06:08 PM||||Ozzy~~~ he took NO offense whatsoever...He thought it was amusing that I got such a response. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If he does take offense to something, I am sure he would be the first to tell ya. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>You guys are Great...Like I said before I am either laughing with you guys or learning from you all.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||10
